{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Starship is a 2D space construction and simulation game, where you design and upgrade your own star ship. Use it to explore vibrant star systems, uncover unique resources, and discover hidden secrets. Your choices shape your experience \u2014 become a daring pirate hunter, a resourceful miner, a space engineer, a reliable spacebus driver, and more! Dive into colorful star systems in this ever-expanding sandbox environment, and enjoy regular free updates throughout the development process. Your journey through the cosmos is just beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/a85097800700107ee91eec884b6f8e48.poster.avif?t=1770209693\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/a85097800700107ee91eec884b6f8e48.webm?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/a85097800700107ee91eec884b6f8e48.mp4?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/e24b1bb6ab41aad5451d194dcb075f97.webp?t=1770209693\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/509eaa3af77809e0bbc3b1679df2bcb2.poster.avif?t=1770209693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/509eaa3af77809e0bbc3b1679df2bcb2.webm?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/509eaa3af77809e0bbc3b1679df2bcb2.mp4?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your crew awaiting orders, it\u2019s time to bring your starship to life. Build the vessel of your wildest imagination, or recreate legendary ships from iconic movies and fiction. Stop by the local space colony to gather equipment and supplies. Start with a reactor to power your engines, and then lay down crucial pipework and electrical systems. Keep life support steady, or your journey may be cut short.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/487be6d441d58d2f521d12970f43b6c4.webp?t=1770209693\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the full potential of our community\u2019s creativity through ship sharing on the Steam Workshop. If you can envision it, you can design it, share it, and let others engage in epic adventures and battles with your creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/eeeb60d7cae30bc0281e2ba7af137141.webp?t=1770209693\" width=600 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/bc8ea3b74585b4cc1ecb73177466eb52.poster.avif?t=1770209693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/bc8ea3b74585b4cc1ecb73177466eb52.webm?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/bc8ea3b74585b4cc1ecb73177466eb52.mp4?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full command of your starship\u2019s arsenal. Will you mount lasers for precision shots, or railguns for devastating impact? Do you favor heavier armor for resilience, or enhanced agility to outmaneuver foes? Opt for stealth to slip by unnoticed, or load up on raw firepower to dominate the battlefield. The Last Starship isn\u2019t just about firepower; it\u2019s a test of tactical thinking, where each encounter demands careful planning, adaptability, and precise strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/97d5d6168cbb2cce433b18beaf001c98.webp?t=1770209693\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/8819ee4020637552770a5c642d8e2c5e.poster.avif?t=1770209693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/8819ee4020637552770a5c642d8e2c5e.webm?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/8819ee4020637552770a5c642d8e2c5e.mp4?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sector map opens the gateway to a vibrant, procedurally generated universe brimming with missions, anomalies, and unexpected discoveries. Meet a diverse array of characters \u2014 some allies, some adversaries \u2014 each with their own compelling stories and requests for help. Embark on daring rescues, deliver vital cargo, or hunt down notorious pirates. Every decision you make shapes your path, carving your unique journey through an ever-changing galaxy full of wonder and peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/d355159e7fe020c7dd834df70a636813.webp?t=1770209693\" width=600 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/52c6df497e17b19709c431d2304c2783.poster.avif?t=1770209693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/52c6df497e17b19709c431d2304c2783.webm?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/52c6df497e17b19709c431d2304c2783.mp4?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space is cold, dark, and vast. To survive, you must gather essential resources \u2014 water, oxygen, and fuel \u2014 to maintain your ships and sustain your crew. Whether you\u2019re deploying drones for space wreck salvage, or using lasers to extract raw materials for a massive mining rig, establishing a seamless operation is crucial. Only then, can you secure the resources needed to thrive in the depths of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/d36c7ed8f7e6e76d8b330940eddc3e4d.webp?t=1770209693\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Starship is the latest creation from acclaimed indie developer, Introversion Software, best known for the BAFTA winning game, Prison Architect. The game launched in February 2026 and is being updated regularly, with new missions, bug fixes, and gameplay enhancements, based on your feedback. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introversion Software has been developing games since 2001, and stands behind acclaimed titles like Uplink, Darwinia, DEFCON, Multiwinia, and Scanner Sombre. Our most successful game, Prison Architect, launched into early access in 2012, captivated over four million players, and over a 6 year span, received 54 major content updates \u2014 averaging one per month.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Paint Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1857080/3e0403666e086a8028ac57a1211adf0a46381cf3.jpg"},{"name":"The Undiscovered sector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1857080/ff0c50b7c8d93fc3df56e12494bc76f8d8838213.jpg"},{"name":"Share a ship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1857080/b92782883250ae5379136f7d54509014383f0f50.jpg"},{"name":"Stargate Phase 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1857080/d778d87d4ba850bb9e17e34b7ee59c9883826d60.jpg"},{"name":"Stargate Phase 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1857080/8360b4eb89cecac00e2c5a580fa7d37f45124194.jpg"},{"name":"Stargate Phase 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1857080/3fdf7e8aab3bb124898b278cee7377e28a233a69.jpg"},{"name":"Stargate Phase 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1857080/e5da05c61b08ba7f0183e27b70fe6ba6fd02629c.jpg"},{"name":"Stargate Phase 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1857080/3391570f5fca29adb72d28db906f9bc8cfe166d6.jpg"},{"name":"Stargate Phase 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1857080/f251b1bb09042cc5de4b1b443fa0593e5aed37fa.jpg"},{"name":"Stargate Phase 7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1857080/d05b55336e29e9174538d0bf281d855296ad75e0.jpg"}],"total":37},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1857080?t=1770209693","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770209693","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/a9dd7f8d10c19ee37ccfa47a44cf90023115d059/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770209693","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/a9dd7f8d10c19ee37ccfa47a44cf90023115d059/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770209693","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2214790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Discord Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/f36d34f397e11bcc04c9dbaa896cb970.avif?t=1770209693\" width=546 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our vibrant Discord community! Search for <i>&quot;The Last Starship&quot;</i> on Discord or click the link in the link box on this page to connect with fellow explorers and be part of the adventure!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Starship is a 2D space construction and simulation game, where you design and upgrade your own star ship. Use it to explore vibrant star systems, uncover unique resources, and discover hidden secrets. Your choices shape your experience \u2014 become a daring pirate hunter, a resourceful miner, a space engineer, a reliable spacebus driver, and more! Dive into colorful star systems in this ever-expanding sandbox environment, and enjoy regular free updates throughout the development process. Your journey through the cosmos is just beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/a85097800700107ee91eec884b6f8e48.poster.avif?t=1770209693\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/a85097800700107ee91eec884b6f8e48.webm?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/a85097800700107ee91eec884b6f8e48.mp4?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/e24b1bb6ab41aad5451d194dcb075f97.webp?t=1770209693\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/509eaa3af77809e0bbc3b1679df2bcb2.poster.avif?t=1770209693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/509eaa3af77809e0bbc3b1679df2bcb2.webm?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/509eaa3af77809e0bbc3b1679df2bcb2.mp4?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your crew awaiting orders, it\u2019s time to bring your starship to life. Build the vessel of your wildest imagination, or recreate legendary ships from iconic movies and fiction. Stop by the local space colony to gather equipment and supplies. Start with a reactor to power your engines, and then lay down crucial pipework and electrical systems. Keep life support steady, or your journey may be cut short.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/487be6d441d58d2f521d12970f43b6c4.webp?t=1770209693\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the full potential of our community\u2019s creativity through ship sharing on the Steam Workshop. If you can envision it, you can design it, share it, and let others engage in epic adventures and battles with your creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/eeeb60d7cae30bc0281e2ba7af137141.webp?t=1770209693\" width=600 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/bc8ea3b74585b4cc1ecb73177466eb52.poster.avif?t=1770209693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/bc8ea3b74585b4cc1ecb73177466eb52.webm?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/bc8ea3b74585b4cc1ecb73177466eb52.mp4?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full command of your starship\u2019s arsenal. Will you mount lasers for precision shots, or railguns for devastating impact? Do you favor heavier armor for resilience, or enhanced agility to outmaneuver foes? Opt for stealth to slip by unnoticed, or load up on raw firepower to dominate the battlefield. The Last Starship isn\u2019t just about firepower; it\u2019s a test of tactical thinking, where each encounter demands careful planning, adaptability, and precise strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/97d5d6168cbb2cce433b18beaf001c98.webp?t=1770209693\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/8819ee4020637552770a5c642d8e2c5e.poster.avif?t=1770209693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/8819ee4020637552770a5c642d8e2c5e.webm?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/8819ee4020637552770a5c642d8e2c5e.mp4?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sector map opens the gateway to a vibrant, procedurally generated universe brimming with missions, anomalies, and unexpected discoveries. Meet a diverse array of characters \u2014 some allies, some adversaries \u2014 each with their own compelling stories and requests for help. Embark on daring rescues, deliver vital cargo, or hunt down notorious pirates. Every decision you make shapes your path, carving your unique journey through an ever-changing galaxy full of wonder and peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/d355159e7fe020c7dd834df70a636813.webp?t=1770209693\" width=600 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/52c6df497e17b19709c431d2304c2783.poster.avif?t=1770209693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/52c6df497e17b19709c431d2304c2783.webm?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/52c6df497e17b19709c431d2304c2783.mp4?t=1770209693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space is cold, dark, and vast. To survive, you must gather essential resources \u2014 water, oxygen, and fuel \u2014 to maintain your ships and sustain your crew. Whether you\u2019re deploying drones for space wreck salvage, or using lasers to extract raw materials for a massive mining rig, establishing a seamless operation is crucial. Only then, can you secure the resources needed to thrive in the depths of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857080/extras/d36c7ed8f7e6e76d8b330940eddc3e4d.webp?t=1770209693\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Starship is the latest creation from acclaimed indie developer, Introversion Software, best known for the BAFTA winning game, Prison Architect. The game launched in February 2026 and is being updated regularly, with new missions, bug fixes, and gameplay enhancements, based on your feedback. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introversion Software has been developing games since 2001, and stands behind acclaimed titles like Uplink, Darwinia, DEFCON, Multiwinia, and Scanner Sombre. Our most successful game, Prison Architect, launched into early access in 2012, captivated over four million players, and over a 6 year span, received 54 major content updates \u2014 averaging one per month.</p>","developers":["Introversion Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"S